    <div class="container">
        <!-- Overview Section -->
        <section id="overview">
            <h2>Overview of Belote</h2>
            <p>Belote is a popular French trick-taking card game typically played by four players in two teams. It's one of the most played card games in France and is also popular in many other European countries.</p>
            
            <div class="card-container">
                <div class="card">
                    <h3>Game Basics</h3>
                    <ul>
                        <li><strong>Players:</strong> 4 (2 teams of 2)</li>
                        <li><strong>Deck:</strong> 32-card French deck</li>
                        <li><strong>Card Distribution:</strong> 5 cards initially, then 3 more after bidding</li>
                        <li><strong>Game Type:</strong> Trick-taking</li>
                        <li><strong>Skills:</strong> Strategy, Memory, Teamwork</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                
                <!-- Other cards remain the same -->
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Other sections (Rules, Scoring, etc.) remain the same -->
